WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.170 --> 00:00:17.557
"I hope Cozlin isn't too upset with me," Roxy thought.

2
00:00:18.237 --> 00:00:21.839
She had spent the past few hours watching as fighters paired up and battled.

3
00:00:22.720 --> 00:00:24.621
The Battle Master appeared on his platform.

4
00:00:24.641 --> 00:00:30.344
"Next we have Kothar, the terror with four arms!"

5
00:00:31.232 --> 00:00:35.054
The crowd cheered as a massive, hairy beast drifted to the middle of the stadium.

6
00:00:35.875 --> 00:00:37.195
The Battle Master continued.

7
00:00:37.215 --> 00:00:41.778
"His partner is Volgren, from the ocean planet Zell!"

8
00:00:43.819 --> 00:00:45.600
He waited for the crowd to grow quiet.

9
00:00:45.620 --> 00:00:49.482
"They will fight Rocket Girl and Sun Wukong!"

10
00:00:53.124 --> 00:00:56.586
A moment later Roxy and Wukong stood on the stadium floor.

11
00:00:57.246 --> 00:00:59.127
Wukong twirled his iron bar.

12
00:00:59.147 --> 00:01:00.308
"This will be fun!"

13
00:01:01.852 --> 00:01:02.833
Roxy shook her head.

14
00:01:02.853 --> 00:01:04.814
"Fighting isn't fun at all.

15
00:01:05.214 --> 00:01:06.875
And we both need to get back home."

16
00:01:07.675 --> 00:01:08.556
Wukong shrugged.

17
00:01:08.576 --> 00:01:09.596
"You're right.

18
00:01:09.916 --> 00:01:11.237
Let's win this battle quickly."

19
00:01:13.618 --> 00:01:15.580
Volgren attacked, swinging tentacles.

20
00:01:16.260 --> 00:01:18.761
Roxy dodged it and then fired her eye laser beams.

21
00:01:19.342 --> 00:01:21.903
Whiz-hoo! "Aargh!"

22
00:01:22.263 --> 00:01:23.004
Volgren cried.

23
00:01:23.024 --> 00:01:25.345
"Nice shot, Rocket Girl!"

24
00:01:25.885 --> 00:01:29.547
Wukong swung his iron bar at Kothar, who blocked it with one of his arms.

25
00:01:29.567 --> 00:01:32.745
"Ouch!" The beast rubbed his arm.

26
00:01:33.425 --> 00:01:34.226
Wukong laughed.

27
00:01:35.347 --> 00:01:37.609
Kothar snarled and charged toward him.

28
00:01:38.349 --> 00:01:41.752
He grabbed Wukong in one of his huge hands and squeezed hard.

29
00:01:42.192 --> 00:01:43.613
Wukong tried to break free.

30
00:01:44.534 --> 00:01:46.835
Kothar laughed.

31
00:01:48.677 --> 00:01:54.361
"You'll never escape from—" Wukong turned into a fish and slipped out of the beast's hand.

32
00:01:54.881 --> 00:01:57.223
He flopped on the ground and then turned into a wasp.

33
00:01:59.428 --> 00:02:01.409
Buzz! Kothar ran around, waving his arms.

34
00:02:01.429 --> 00:02:02.970
"Don't sting me!"

35
00:02:03.870 --> 00:02:05.451
Roxy darted toward Volgren.

36
00:02:06.472 --> 00:02:09.193
Pow! She threw the alien into the stadium wall.

37
00:02:09.213 --> 00:02:12.835
"Grr!" Volgren climbed to her feet.

38
00:02:13.356 --> 00:02:16.717
Then she spread out her tentacles, revealing rows of shiny eggs.

39
00:02:17.638 --> 00:02:21.300
Fwoomp! An egg shot at Roxy, and she jumped out of the way.

40
00:02:21.660 --> 00:02:22.861
The egg hit the wall.

41
00:02:23.321 --> 00:02:26.002
Ka-boom! "Yikes!"

42
00:02:26.463 --> 00:02:27.143
Roxy cried.

43
00:02:27.163 --> 00:02:28.904
"An exploding egg!"

44
00:02:29.784 --> 00:02:32.286
Fwoomp! Another egg shot toward Roxy.

45
00:02:34.107 --> 00:02:36.268
She ducked, and it hit Kothar in the face.

46
00:02:36.589 --> 00:02:38.250
Ka-boom! "Ow!"

47
00:02:38.810 --> 00:02:40.271
The hairy beast rubbed his eyes.

48
00:02:40.291 --> 00:02:41.872
"That hurt, Volgren!

49
00:02:42.292 --> 00:02:44.434
Watch where you're—" Buzz!

50
00:02:44.934 --> 00:02:46.735
Wukong zipped into the beast's ear.

51
00:02:47.756 --> 00:02:49.437
He raised his stinger and stabbed.

52
00:02:50.498 --> 00:02:54.521
"Aargh!" Kothar howled in pain as Wukong flew back out.

53
00:02:55.221 --> 00:02:56.722
Volgren fired more eggs.

54
00:02:57.463 --> 00:02:59.284
Roxy took a deep breath and then blew.

55
00:02:59.744 --> 00:03:04.008
Whoo-oo-oosh! Her super breath blew the eggs back toward Volgren.

56
00:03:05.349 --> 00:03:06.670
Volgren's eyes went wide.

57
00:03:06.690 --> 00:03:09.032
"Uh-oh!" Boom!

58
00:03:09.832 --> 00:03:11.934
She flew backward, slamming into the wall.

59
00:03:11.954 --> 00:03:14.556
"Oof!" Slowly she stood up.

60
00:03:16.838 --> 00:03:18.640
Roxy fired her eye laser beams.

61
00:03:19.260 --> 00:03:23.724
Whiz-hoo! They blasted the eggs, setting off multiple explosions.

62
00:03:25.946 --> 00:03:28.388
When the smoke cleared, Volgren raised her tentacles.

63
00:03:29.444 --> 00:03:29.884
"I give up!"

64
00:03:30.845 --> 00:03:31.806
"Well, I don't!"

65
00:03:32.386 --> 00:03:34.027
Kothar leaped toward Wukong.

66
00:03:34.368 --> 00:03:35.789
The monkey stepped to the side.

67
00:03:36.269 --> 00:03:40.592
As soon as Kothar landed, Wukong slammed his bar onto the beast's toes.

68
00:03:40.612 --> 00:03:45.596
"Yow!" Kothar hopped on one foot, rubbing his toes.

69
00:03:46.356 --> 00:03:48.157
Then he swung a hairy fist.

70
00:03:48.538 --> 00:03:53.341
Pow! It sent Wukong flying into the crowd, crashing into the blue alien.

71
00:03:54.002 --> 00:03:55.883
The alien looked down at his spilled drink.

72
00:03:58.436 --> 00:03:58.696
"Oh man!"

73
00:03:58.716 --> 00:04:01.277
Kothar held up four fists as the crowd cheered.

74
00:04:01.297 --> 00:04:02.418
"That's right!

75
00:04:02.938 --> 00:04:03.899
I'm the best!

76
00:04:04.539 --> 00:04:07.881
Nobody can A huge shadow grew over Kothar.

77
00:04:08.201 --> 00:04:09.261
He looked up and gulped.

78
00:04:10.062 --> 00:04:11.502
Wukong towered over him.

79
00:04:11.522 --> 00:04:13.844
"Do you still want to fight?"

80
00:04:14.844 --> 00:04:16.325
Kothar's shoulders slumped.

81
00:04:16.985 --> 00:04:22.108
"No." The crowd cheered as the Battle Master declared Roxy and Wukong the winners.
